d within the Red Zone."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Sentry","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What is that?!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Bright blue orbs of flames light up in pairs amidst the light green fog like eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Jet_Passby","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whum... The unidentified aircraft comes hurtling in their direction, its fiery tail leaving a bright trail in the sky."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":6,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ramzan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We have a situation. Withdraw at once."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏3"}],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's coming for us? Find cover!!!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The aircraft passes by at low altitude, and a shell falls on them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Boom!!! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Tongues of flames and black smoke rise into the sky amidst the explosion."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ramzan!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"41","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"spark","raw":"火花"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_20Winter_Burnfire_Loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The aircraft roars away in an instant. Anna immediately scrambles to her feet and stumbles towards where she remembers her men are. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"There are no soldiers standing anymore. One of the survivors is trying to save his comrade next to him, but even just dragging the comrade a little makes him howl in agony. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Memories of the past suddenly wash over Anna like a large wave."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gunshots, pitiful wails and cries, the delirious moans of dying people... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The terror-stricken crowd, the girl shivering behind a safety box, her eyes brimming with tears..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":30,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","value":"0.1","raw":"Shake"},{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Someone grabs Anna by the arm, making her shudder."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Alexander","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,60"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Alexander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ma'am!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Half of Alexander's face is suffering from burns. He is in a terrible state."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":6,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Ramzan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Anna? Anna!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ramzan also claws his way out of a mud pit. His protective suit is riddled with holes and scorch marks."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Rope","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ramzan holds on to Anna's arm as if to make sure of something. Then he drops her arm and pays no more attention to her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Pamzan","expression":6,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_connect","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Ramzan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Dolls, to me. Prepare to force our way through."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The smoke slowly dissipates."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Team_Running","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They can just about make out the rows of heavily armed soldiers closing in on them from a distance..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":29,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoever can still move in 3rd Platoon, follow me! We're getting out of here!","style":{"size":"50"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
